WEBVTT

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.600
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.320
New TV program, come out!

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.690
I'm Harukaze Doremi.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:11.650
I've just started learning magic.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.070
I'm still not good at it, but...

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:15.490
Thanks to it, every day is full of surprises.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.620
You all will cheer me on, right?

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.200
I'll be the shining heroine in this ultra-hyper new TV program:

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.040
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.040
Look forward to it!

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.580
Do-re-mi-fa-so-la-ti-do...

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:25.460
Huh?

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:45.220
Welcome to the Maho-dou!

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:49.580
We offer a great selection to fulfill your wishes.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:03:02.160
Anything can be fulfilled by a magic pendant.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:05.030
However, after a wish is granted,

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:09.060
who knows what could happen to the one who used it?

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:31.640
I'm Doremi! I'm a Witch Apprentice!!

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:38.690
Puapua Arukuku!

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:41.460
Alright!

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:43.870
Got the magic spell perfectly!

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.830
Pop is still asleep.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:00.590
Doremi!

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:03.220
Jeez! Why are you up?

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.840
Doremi's sure up early!

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:07.600
Are you in love with a boy again?

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:09.350
T-t-t-that's not it!

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:11.100
I just got some stuff to do at school.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:12.970
What a cheap lie.

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.660
It has nothing to do with you!

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:20.520
It's hopeless, so are you still going to try anyway?

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.490
N-no, I mean...

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:28.950
Today you said that you would tend the garden!

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:29.820
I can't...

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:32.200
There's this new rod that I have to try.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.180
Wait a second!

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:35.500
Did you buy a new rod again!?

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.540
Jeez! This month too! With all the housework!

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:40.340
Help!

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:40.460
Jeez! This month too! With all the housework!

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:42.920
Hold It! You better come back here!

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:43.700
Stop right there!

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:46.170
My name's Harukaze Doremi.

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:49.220
My parents always fight like crazy every day.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:52.890
My little sister is a kindergartener, but she's so conceited and thinks she's a huge know-it-all.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:57.020
Therefore, I'm the world's unluckiest pretty girl.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:03.400
But, today I will try again to become the happiest pretty girl in the world.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:23.170
Igarashi-sempai...

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.960
He's sooo coooool!

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:30.360
Igarashi-kun!

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:33.890
Promise me you'll win... today's match?

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:35.400
S-Sure...

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:38.770
If you win... I have something to tell you, Igarashi-kun.

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:41.480
So that's why...

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:42.860
Promise me!

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:43.920
Sure.

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:45.140
See you...

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:51.820
Puapua Arukuku!

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:54.960
Please give me the courage to confess to Igarashi-sempai.

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:56.700
Alright!

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.120
Ah, he's coming!

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:03.400
I must do it today!

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:04.880
Go, Doremi!

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:06.960
Now! Now I said!

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:09.630
Ahh! I missed him!

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:12.600
I thought I already used the spell!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.420
I have to tell him how I feel!

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:17.720
But I don't seem to be doing that now...

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:20.400
Ahh... I have to tell him...

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:23.880
Once again it's the same thing over and over...

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:34.120
The magic spell didn't work at all.

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:35.060
After all...

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:39.240
I am the world's unluckiest pretty girl.

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:43.120
Look up!

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:47.440
In the middle... of an open field...

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:49.130
take a deep breath...

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:51.090
Book: Japanese Language
take a deep breath...

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:55.050
If I were a witch, I could use magic to confess.

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:58.060
I wonder if I can learn some from this.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:59.800
Alright, Sugiyama, that's okay.

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:01.020
Looks like you're prepared.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.280
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.940
Okay, next will be Harukaze!

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:06.000
Doremi-chan!

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:08.420
From the last part on page 5.

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:09.770
Hadzuki-chan, thanks!

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:12.690
Witches' Profile.

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:14.780
Witches always wear gloves.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:14.840
Book: About Witches
Witches always wear gloves.

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:18.080
Witches will look at you with red eyes.
Book: About Witches

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.660
Witches hate childr-
Book: About Witches

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:24.750
Harukaze, hallway.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.330
Yes, ma'am...

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:29.260
Clumsy Domiso.

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:31.720
Not "Domiso," It's Do-re-mi!

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:34.350
Ah? Dojimi? (clumsy girl)

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:37.220
DO-RE-MIIIII!!!

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.600
Can it!

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:40.740
Get out, both of you!

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:49.360
Doremi-chan, you're going to watch the soccer match, right?

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:55.030
You're not cheering for Igarashi-sempai?

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:00.290
Could it be that you failed again with your confession?

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:06.820
Hadzuki-chan, could you cover for me at the match?

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:07.600
Yeah, sure.

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:08.960
Ah, but...!

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:10.170
Doremi-chan!

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:15.470
Look-at-the-clum-sy-stu-pid-giiiiirl!

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:18.860
Ah, this is the worst!

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:23.340
Is it that weird for me to want to use magic?

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.320
Before I realized it...

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:39.780
I was standing on an unknown hill road.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:51.040
Makihataya...

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:54.000
Marika's Maho-dou.

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:57.130
Somehow this place gives me the creeps.

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:09.100
Welcome.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:12.060
G-good afternoon!

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:15.030
Welcome to the Maho-dou!

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:18.990
We offer a great selection to fulfill your wishes.

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:21.530
Gloves?

00:09:21.530 --> 00:09:24.500
"Witches always wear gloves."

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:31.210
"Witches will look at you with red eyes."

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:39.630
"Witches hate children and they can smell children..."

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:41.130
"...with their big noses."

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:44.300
Everything matches...

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:52.140
Could... she be... the real deal?

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:58.240
Anything can be fulfilled by a magic pendant.

00:09:58.920 --> 00:09:59.860
Magic?

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:03.280
However, after a wish is granted...

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:04.030
Excuse me?

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:06.620
What is it? I haven't finished talking!

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.580
Makihataya Marika-san...

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.760
Makihataya <i>Marika</i>!?

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:13.670
Jeez, this is why I hate kids.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.670
Eh? You hate kids?

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.130
That means...

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:20.090
Just as I thought!

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:22.010
Rika-san is...

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:23.510
W-What is it?

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:24.970
...none other than...

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:26.730
Don't say it!

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:37.360
A witch!

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:03.350
You brat, you'll pay for turning me into this!

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:05.640
What? What did I do?

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:07.300
Did I do something?

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:12.480
Well, a witch will turn into this form, a Witch Frog, if you figure out her disguise and expose her.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:14.770
You have to take responsibility!

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:16.520
Even if I'm responsible,

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:19.360
I have no idea how to use magic.

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:21.150
But it was nice talking to you and...

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:22.620
maybe I'll just come back another time.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:23.760
Bye...!

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:24.820
Freeze!

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:29.530
If you think we'll let you leave right now, you're gravely mistaken.

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:31.040
Exactly!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:35.800
I'm not letting you leave until I turn you into a witch!

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:37.670
But...

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:39.720
Eh? A witch?

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:05.960
Makihatayama Rika is my name in the Human World.

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.900
My real name in the Witch World is Majo Rika.

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:10.450
I'm her fairy, Lala.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:12.320
I'm Harukaze Doremi.

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:13.620
Doremi?

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.540
Wow, what a weird name.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:18.910
Still better than Makihatayama Rika.

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:22.000
How dare you, a human, say that!?

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:24.210
Come now, calm down, calm down!

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:28.380
You lost your original witch's body and you can't turn back.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:31.180
There's no other way than to teach this girl to be a witch, right?

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:33.390
Well, that's true...

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.810
The road to become a witch is VERY strict!

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:39.110
It won't be a walk in the park under MY guidance!

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:42.560
I will put you through such tribulations!

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.480
That's okay with me!

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:45.530
She doesn't get it.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:48.990
Kid, you could at least look a little scared.

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:53.120
But, but, I've always wanted to be a witch.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:54.950
Please, hurry up, teach me some magic!

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:56.540
Hey, come on!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:00.060
Somehow I'm starting to have second thoughts.

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:03.520
Lala, could you bring us the box in my room?

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:04.840
Sure thing.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:06.680
This way, Doremi.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:07.380
Right.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:12.620
Alright.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:17.560
Here... we...

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:19.430
...go.

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:22.690
In this box, you'll find Taps, items used by witch apprentices.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:23.650
Go on and take one.

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:32.320
Huh?

00:13:38.320 --> 00:13:39.330
Got it!

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:41.160
Alright.

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:42.460
Now then, next is...

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:44.000
This is so cute!

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:45.960
Ah, it plays notes!

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:48.980
Hey you! Stop playing with it!

00:13:48.980 --> 00:13:50.260
What does this button do?

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:53.470
You idiot!

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:55.730
A witch uniform?

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:58.760
You have to put on the apprentice uniform before the music stops!

00:13:58.760 --> 00:13:58.920
Hurry!

00:13:58.920 --> 00:13:59.520
No way!

00:13:59.520 --> 00:13:59.760
Hurry!

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:00.770
Before the music stops!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.310
How do I put this on?

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:04.920
It disappeared.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:05.580
I told you so.

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:08.440
Oh, it's not the end of the world! Try it again!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:19.720
After putting the uniform on, hit Do-Mi-So-Do and then Do-Fa-La-Do on your Tap.

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:20.790
Okay, okay!

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:24.540
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.300
What in the world was that?

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:27.720
This is so cool!

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:48.570
Wow, cool, cool!

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:49.360
Okay, next is...

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:49.860
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:51.680
I can cast magic with this stick, right?

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:52.690
What's the spell?

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:53.800
Tell me quick!

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:55.000
There is a spell, right?

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:56.300
Is there?

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:58.820
Come on, hurry-hurry-hurry-tell-me-tell-me!

00:14:58.820 --> 00:15:00.060
The spell! The spell! Hurry-hurry-hurry!

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:01.530
Shut your mouth!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:02.870
Jeez!

00:15:02.870 --> 00:15:04.580
That's not a stick.

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:06.460
It's called a Peperuto Poron, a musical instrument.

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:07.670
A musical instrument?

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:10.500
You wave it and sing:

00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:13.920
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto as your spell.

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:17.720
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto?

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:19.390
Alright!

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:24.220
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:26.440
Big steak...

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.270
Appear!

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:32.020
Wow!

00:15:32.020 --> 00:15:35.530
This is the first time I've seen a steak this big!

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:36.240
Alright!

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:39.200
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:42.210
Become bigger, bigger, and bigger!

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:47.130
It's time to...

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:48.060
Ah?

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:50.140
Your magic isn't permanent.

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:53.460
So stop wasting your magic spheres like that!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:54.420
Magic spheres?

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:57.130
They're the balls inside the Peperuto Poron.

00:15:57.130 --> 00:15:58.310
Ah, you're right.

00:15:58.310 --> 00:15:59.550
Some of them are gone.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.090
So, let's refill it.

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:06.260
Magic can't be cast without magic spheres.

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:13.320
Okay.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:14.060
Thanks.

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:21.660
Jeez, from now on, to become a witch, exams are...

00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:29.780
Lala?

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:30.710
Right.

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:43.840
Hold!

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:46.980
Thanks.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:48.810
That's my school!

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:49.930
I know!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.940
We have to defend!

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:58.860
She just had to be absent at a time like this...

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:03.290
Huh? Isn't that the match?

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.420
Ah, Igarashi-sempai, watch out!

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:11.830
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:14.320
Time, stop!

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:19.130
Whoa, time really sto... oof!

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:23.010
Igarashi-sempai, excuse me!

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:24.140
Hurry up!

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:25.000
The magic is wearing off!

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.340
Eh!? No way! I'm still...

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:27.100
Hurry up!

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:27.800
Right!

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:34.980
This is...

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:36.600
Huh?

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:40.460
Hi...

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:41.480
Bye!

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:44.450
What was that about?

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:50.200
We did it!

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:53.920
Uh-oh, did I do something bad?

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:55.790
It's not over! It's not the end yet!

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:56.830
Go for it!

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:57.880
It's not over! It's not the end yet!

00:17:58.390 --> 00:17:59.630
You really screwed up.

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:05.050
Anyway, if someone from the crowd exposes you as a witch,

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:08.840
what happened to Majo Rika would happen to you too.

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:13.680
This way, this way!

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:15.600
Yuuuuck!

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:17.440
Stretcher, hurry!

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:18.360
Igarashi-kun!

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:21.360
He's injured?

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:24.200
Alright, I'll heal him with magic!

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.110
You can't!

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:31.100
If you heal someone with your magic, you will receive the wound! It's forbidden!

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:32.380
But...

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:33.790
Huh? That girl...

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:36.460
She bought a pendant from Majo Rika.

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:42.200
Don't tell me...!

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:47.040
Igarashi-kun.

00:18:49.550 --> 00:18:51.350
I don't care what happens to me.

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:53.260
Please help Igarashi-kun!

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:54.850
His wound...

00:18:57.680 --> 00:18:59.320
Heal his wound!

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.020
There it goes.

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:09.200
Huh?

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:10.340
It doesn't hurt anymore.

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:12.300
His wound is healed!

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:13.160
It really is!

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:15.410
I don't understand what's going on, but...

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:16.480
Resume the match!

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:17.960
Yeah!!!

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:26.580
Igarashi-kun, thank goodness.

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:31.640
Igarashi's wound has now been transferred to her.

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:33.640
I wonder if it hurts.

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:35.220
But still, she looks happy...

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:38.940
Looks like she likes Igarashi-kun a lot.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:39.900
Looks like it.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:43.100
But if I were to face the same situation,

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:44.810
I probably couldn't do it.

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:46.440
What?

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:49.320
Could it be that you like him too?

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:50.660
Watch out!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.860
Don't let him get through!

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:54.960
Ah, they're going to tackle him again!

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:57.700
Alright!

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:01.380
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:03.500
Time, stop!

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.170
For her sake, I will protect him!

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:09.510
Hurry, hurry!

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:10.260
I know!

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:11.220
Let's see...

00:20:11.220 --> 00:20:13.130
Like this?

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:17.940
Here goes!

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:22.730
Jeez!

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:27.520
I'm really...

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:30.160
the world's unlucki...

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:35.570
There, all better now.

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:36.820
Thank you very much.

00:20:36.820 --> 00:20:37.880
I was surprised.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:40.700
I thought you went home a long time ago.

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:42.170
Sorry.

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:44.640
Hey, look what's happening over there.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:46.090
Over where?

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:47.560
It's Maki-san.

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:49.210
Igarashi-kun came to visit her.

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:53.170
Come on, let's leave them.

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:54.240
But...

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:55.680
Come on, Doremi-chan.

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:01.810
Thanks, for cheering for me.

00:21:01.810 --> 00:21:02.440
Sure.

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:04.310
Thanks to you, we won.

00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:06.560
It's because you did your best, Igarashi-kun.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:09.260
Hey...

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:13.900
Earlier you said that you have something to tell me?

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:15.000
Yes.

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:16.980
Well, I also...

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.160
...have something to tell you.

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:23.910
I'd like you to go out... with me.

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:39.280
Jeez!

00:21:39.280 --> 00:21:40.440
What are they doing?

00:21:41.140 --> 00:21:43.680
She's not a witch apprentice.

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:46.440
She's a troublesome witch, an Ojamajo!

00:21:46.440 --> 00:21:50.480
And who's the one that was found out by that Ojamajo?

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:54.940
I have a hunch that Doremi will become a good witch.

00:21:58.200 --> 00:21:59.420
This mood is...

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:01.870
Mutual love, there's no mistake.

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:04.300
I see.

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:05.460
Looks like it.

00:22:05.460 --> 00:22:07.370
They should be together.

00:22:07.370 --> 00:22:08.830
Doremi-chan?

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:11.790
I get a feeling that you're giving up.

00:22:11.790 --> 00:22:12.720
Doremi-chan?

00:22:14.660 --> 00:22:15.670
That's right!

00:22:15.670 --> 00:22:18.720
Yet another bad premonition.

00:22:19.460 --> 00:22:24.680
I really am the world's unluckiest pretty girl.

00:22:31.820 --> 00:22:33.770
I want to be Doremi-chan.

00:22:33.770 --> 00:22:34.480
Why?

00:22:34.480 --> 00:22:37.110
The smart and rich Hadzuki-chan?

00:22:37.110 --> 00:22:38.610
Why?

00:22:38.610 --> 00:22:40.820
Alright, as a witch apprentice,

00:22:40.820 --> 00:22:42.820
I can fulfill that wish.

00:22:42.820 --> 00:22:44.830
Hadzuki-chan and I will trade places.

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:47.950
I'm so excited just by thinking about it.

00:22:47.950 --> 00:22:50.210
It's so nice when they eat steak for dinner!

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:52.630
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:52.920 --> 00:22:54.670
I Become Hadzuki-chan!

00:22:55.670 --> 00:22:57.920
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
